</div>

<div class="colophon">
  PUNARVAAS · {{ d.district }} · {{ d.snapshot_id }} · ruleset {{ manifest.ruleset_version }} ·
  {{ d.cells|num }} cells · {{ habitations|length }} habitations · {{ n_sites }} candidate
  parcels ({{ n_accepted }} accepted) · Σ capital {{ total_gap_cost|inr_full }} ·
  Σ PV benefit {{ total_pv_benefit|inr_full }}<br>
  Advisory output of a decision-support screening. Not a legal notification of hazard zonation
  and not a substitute for site investigation.
</div>

</main>
</body>
